# Control arm for the gemma4 DPO eval: the stock google/gemma-4-E4B-it weights through the same llama.cpp
# convert + Q4_K_M quantize (no imatrix) as jellyfish-g4-dpo. Compare the two on the 212 val cases; the Ollama
# gemma4:e4b (imatrix Q4_K_M, 175/212) stays the reference. Put the GGUF next to this file, then:
# ollama create jellyfish-g4-requant -f models/Modelfile.g4-requant
FROM ./gemma4-e4b-requant-Q4_K_M.gguf
RENDERER gemma4
PARSER gemma4
PARAMETER temperature 1
PARAMETER top_k 64
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
